      "title": "Help us improve the questionnaires",
      "description": "<p>Thank you for trying the questionnaires, the SmartUrbanity pages that ask about you, how you move around and the places you use.</p><p>Tell us whether you managed to do each thing and how easy it was: when something did not work, a short comment helps us fix it. It takes about 3 minutes and you can skip any question.</p><p>Your answers are used only to validate and improve the tools and are not linked to your name. Only the SmartUrbanity research team reads them, and they are not sent to any public authority.</p>"
